      "created_at": "2014-01-31T21:34:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I just can't wait to get my hands on the decks and explore them, and then start making custom Vengeance-style villain decks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The citizens of the Dawn need their version of the Vengeance crew. &nbsp;It will happen. &nbsp;14 decks is doable. &nbsp;Or maybe just each group as a deck, so 6 that way.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Next we need vengeance style Environment decks. &nbsp;Insula Primalis with the T-Rex deck, a Raptor Deck, Annoying Plants deck, Lava deck and Pterydactyl deck.</p><p>Let's do it!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>All fear the mighty wrath of the Tumbleweed deck!!!</p><p>wwwwwooooooooooooo. . . . (sound of wind blowing over the desert, no expense spared.)</p>",
