      "created_at": "2014-02-01T17:03:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It was something along the lines of putting all targets from Environments into one giant deck and constantly cycling the deck.</p><p>The rule \"Whenever the villain deck is shuffled, play the top card of the villain deck\" makes Ambuscade a bit more threatening. Set a trap? Play a card. Search for Cloaking Device? Play a card. Deck empty? Shuffle trash and play a card. Or you could just have him play multiple cards per turn.</p>",
