      "created_at": "2014-02-01T18:15:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"SuperRick\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/superrick/48/2705_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> SuperRick:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Playing against multiple villians (other than V5):</strong>&nbsp; Very tough because of the diversity amongst the villians.&nbsp; I know HP isn't everything, but my best guess is to divide the individual villian's HP by the total&nbsp;number of villians.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I tried doing Voss and Baron Blade vs 7 heroes a while back… It took a while, but it was pretty easy.</p>",
